<title>USA: GeoResources says N.D. test unproductive.</title>
<headline>GeoResources says N.D. test unproductive.</headline>
<dateline>WILLISTON, N.D. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>GeoResources Inc, a natural resources exploration and production company, said Amerada Hess Corp recently completed unproductive drilling operations on a GeoResources lease in Stark County, N.D.</p>
<p>The test well was plugged on September 17, it said.</p>
<p>Separately, GeoResources said it recently received a permit to drill its Oscar Fossum H3 horizontal well in the Wayne Field of Bottineau County, N.D.</p>
<p>The company said its two prior horizontal wells have been productive.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
